<title>USA: Court approves Italian Oven asset sale.</title>
<headline>Court approves Italian Oven asset sale.</headline>
<text>
<p>LATROBE, Pa, Jan 20 (reuter) - The Italian Oven Inc said Monday the U.S. Bankruptcy Court had approved the sale of &quot;substantially all&quot; of its assets to an affiliate of The Whitecliff Group Inc.</p>
<p>The court, which is overseeing its reorganization under Chapter 11 of the Bankruptcy Code, handed down its decision on January 19, it said.</p>
<p>The company, which filed for protection from its creditors in October, said it expected to complete the sale of its $3.5 million worth of assets before the end of the month.</p>
</text>
